sharedPreferences.edit().putString("jwt_token", jwtToken).apply();
```
**Retrieve the JWT token**:

When your app needs to authenticate with your Spring server, retrieve the stored JWT token:
```java
SharedPreferences sharedPreferences = context.getSharedPreferences("MY_APP_PREFERENCES", Context.MODE_PRIVATE);
String jwtToken = sharedPreferences.getString("jwt_token", "");
```
**Use the JWT token for authentication**:

Include the JWT token in your HTTP requests to your Spring server:
```java
